# A model with a non-ASCII (UTF-8) parameter name, for the protocol's
# UTF-8 round trip (card W35b, docs/protocol.md "state"): before the fix
# a name like this came back in the state event as mojibake (each UTF-8
# byte >=0x80 treated as Latin-1 and re-encoded).
par Iαpp=0.05
v'=Iαpp-v
init v=0
@ total=1,dt=.1
done
